sequenceDiagram
    participant Visitor as Visitante
    participant PWA as ClinicSiteWeb
    participant API as API
    participant Slug as ClinicSiteSlugs_dbo
    participant Site as ClinicSiteProfile

    Visitor->>PWA: GET /s/{slug} ou subdominio
    PWA->>API: GET /api/v1/public/clinic-sites/{slug}
    API->>Slug: resolve TenantId
    API->>Site: load profile + children
    Site-->>API: PublicClinicSiteDto
    API-->>PWA: JSON
    PWA-->>Visitor: paginas servicos equipe contato horarios
